OL,3,GNEWSAFriends murdered woman before
OL,4,Aeating her Cheerios
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women who repeatedly stabbed their
OL,7,Fvulnerable friend before helping
OL,8,Fthemselves to Cheerios have been found
OL,9,Fguilty of murder.
OL,11,FHelen Bloomfield was found dead on a
OL,12,Fblood-stained mattress at her flat in
OL,13,FBraintree, Essex, on 19 April 2024 - a
OL,14,Fmonth after the attack.
OL,16,FThe 52-year-old had been knifed by
OL,17,Ffriends Amy Keely, 40, and Charlotte
OL,18,FJames, 29, before they smothered her
OL,19,Fwith a pillow.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
